<h1>27.17.1 BONUS C [Midnight of War]</h1>
Instrumental <br />

<h1>28.22.1  BONUS D [MAeJdVF !! sneak, normal, fight]</h1>
Verticals done horizontally. 
Sneak, normal, and fighting played without interruptions.

<h1>29.23.1 BONUS E [Easy Peasy Demon Squeezy]</h1>
Reprise. 
The piano bit was supposed to call back on the motif and promote it as a quasi-leitmotif but I instead split it into two tracks. It’s actually fantastic how it reflects my compositional process for some pieces: I’ll lay a melodic or chordal foundation, improvise around it, and return to the main idea once I’ve strayed far from it. Any segments that I keep re-adding after each return eventually make their way into the final score, and this reprise is simply a collection of the moments where I decided a passage would make its way into the score.
